Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ONE HUNDRED YEARS OF SOLITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this home belong to\NJosé Arcadio Buendía?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it, Amaranta?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca arrived on a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She had made the difficult trip\Nfrom Manaure with some hide dealers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,who had taken on the task\Nof delivering her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the bones of her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That she's\Nsome distant cousin of ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter of the indelible Nicanor Ulloa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and his noble wife, Rebeca Montiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.21,0:01:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Daughter of whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But they\Ncould not explain precisely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,who had asked them for the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano,\NArcadio will sleep in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sure.\N-Visitación, prepare a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I move\Ninto Aureliano's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Arcadio is old enough\Nto room with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me a dress you don't wear anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have enough men in this house.\NAnother girl will do us both good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can trust a sister with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The dress, Amaranta!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Many bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when this house\Nbecame some kind of orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As if Arcadio wasn't enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano had the patience
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to read to her\Nthe names of all the saints,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but she did not react to any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucía.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorotea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Inés.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she's a deaf-mute?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, regardless,\Nwe'll call her Rebeca, like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to tell mom what you're up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're afraid to sleep near the freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.\NBesides, you're just the same as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid without any parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,May I sleep in your room tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll sleep in yours\Njust fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Armadillo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts with the letter "A."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like "Arcadio."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"A."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know this letter right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It… it's "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bedtime, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll continue tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we need someone else\Ncaged up in this laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can feed seven,\Nwe can feed eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't eaten anything\Nsince she got here. Not one bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll come running\Nto you the minute her stomach rumbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Rebeca that I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Aureliano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't come out of that laboratory\Nsince the day his brother left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As if he's afraid of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a coffee with your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, believe it or not,\Nwhen I was around your age,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already met your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed as though the whole town\Nknew we would end up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were completely oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least, I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you lock yourself\Nin that room all day, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you selling\Nthose little fish you make?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go for a walk, Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things in life\Nthat you'll never find inside that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mother ask you\Nto tell you to tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference is that unlike you, son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I lived a full life\Nbefore locking myself in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it hadn't been for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd have no Macondo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,no you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,nor anything that makes up your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little fish of yours\Naren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hello.\N-Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I please have a liter of acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And some gold sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta, Rebeca!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"U… A…"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pause this for now, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the spoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataure! Where's Rebeca?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you need help, Dad?\N-No, it's almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?\NLook at your hair and look at Amaranta's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a day, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You must eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, everyone knows that in this house,\Nwe serve the best yam soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving\Nuntil you finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare you, muchachita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to starve yourself, go ahead.\NBut we don't waste food in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataure! Take the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a rest for a second, senora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work that way.\NMy house, my rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go shove that drink\Nup your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can shove that bowl up your--\N-Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little taste, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll let you be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is for you to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you all wanna hear\Nthe story of the old capon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you if you all wanna hear\Nthe story of the old capon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to say, "then don't."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you if you wanted to hear\Nthe story of the old capon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a break, Rebeca.\NYou'll make them go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,More, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not hungry, sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best yam soup in all of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Did you add dirt or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. An animal got in, or…\N…something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataure, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.\N-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Visitación and Cataure\Nrecognized in those eyes the symptoms
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,of a terrible illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cataure fled\Nand never returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the insomnia plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been a long time\Nsince you left your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are just tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not tales, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Visitación.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-You better not put your finger in there.\N-Don't you think you're exaggerating?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am. I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the plague enters the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,no one ever sleeps again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh please, Visitación.\NThat's just superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's real and we never sleep again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get more out of this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them to the plaza\Nonce we finish these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A little fresh air will be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some candy animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come get some candy animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some candy animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, chicken,\Nchicken, chicken, chicken, chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He got out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Buendías\Ndid not become alarmed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,until their third day with no sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine the things we could do\Nwith all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fill this plaza with almond trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ha! I win!\N-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no, no, no, no!\N-Twelve! Fourteen to twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The most fearsome\Npart of the illness
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,was not the impossibility of sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,for the body did not feel\Nany fatigue at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Pass me the, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, it was\Nits inexorable evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.79,0:22:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,towards a more critical state.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,ALMOND TREE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano conceived the strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that would protect them\Nagainst the inevitable loss of memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,WALL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,ANVIL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They went on living\Nin a reality that was slipping away…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,COAL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:22:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,…momentarily captured by words…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,BIRD: FLYING CREATURE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,STOVE: ALL FOOD MUST BE HEATED
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.25,0:23:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,…until they too began to vanish,\Nas did the meaning of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,HAMMER MILL: PUT CORN IN, GRIND
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the names.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,PIG SLAUGHTERING KNIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the notion of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,EGGS: LAID BY CHICKENS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,USE FIRE TO LIGHT THESE CANDLES
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,DON'T PEE IN THE STREETS\NPEOPLE GET ANGRY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,STREETLIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.25,0:23:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,MILK THE COW EVERY MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,BOIL MILK BEFORE MAKING COFFEE WITH MILK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, things are getting complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.88,0:23:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.83,0:23:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, who am I, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.17,0:23:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapist! Rapist! Rapist!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.21,0:23:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! He's your husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.58,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Catarino!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He who has no teeth\Nshall drink, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.33,0:24:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,GOD EXISTS
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula! Go get the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buendía!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, maybe that fighting cock\Ncan finally do your wife a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home and find a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.58,0:25:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,'cause I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.29,0:25:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Prudencio?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.21,0:25:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, finally,\Nthe insomnia plague would strip away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.54,0:25:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,their very sense of self,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.38,0:25:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,sinking them into a state\Nof idiocy that had no past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.75,0:25:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio! José Arcadio!\NWhat is it? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a gypsy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Run back home,\Ntell your father what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.71,0:26:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.63,0:26:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the whole world\Nis shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Devoid of the supernatural\Nfaculties he once possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Melquiades returned to Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was true he had experienced death,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but he had come back,\Nbeing unable to bear the solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.38,0:26:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,DOOR
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SEAT
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.13,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.46,0:28:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your alchemical laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Melquiades!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.96,0:28:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They told me you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.54,0:28:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,COLUMN
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.67,0:29:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,BEING IN THE SUN FOR LONG\NMAKES ME ANGRY
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.92,0:30:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,CHAIR
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.04,0:30:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,INKWELL
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.13,0:31:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this thing's able to capture time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But how, Melquiades?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be patient, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.79,0:31:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.38,0:31:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're ready!\N-I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.04,0:31:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.38,0:31:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano had shot up so fast,\Nhe started wearing his father's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.54,0:31:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,From the confines of the workshop\Nhe shared with Melquiades,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.50,0:31:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,one could scarcely hear him breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.67,0:31:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca was the fairest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.25,0:32:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Her complexion was immaculate.\NShe had large and peaceful eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and magical hands that seemed to\Nembroider designs with invisible threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.29,0:32:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta was somewhat plain,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but she had the natural distinction
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.04,0:32:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and refinement of Petronila,\Nher late grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.42,0:32:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And although he was already\Nshowing the physical drive of his father…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.00,0:32:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.25,0:32:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…Arcadio looked like a child,\Nand some said he had a woman's buttocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.96,0:32:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.75,0:32:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait… Like that. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.83,0:32:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Visitación make you\Nsome bigger pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A few months ago, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.17,0:32:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go. José Arcadio.\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.21,0:32:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a frightened general.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.54,0:33:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.96,0:33:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If that machine does what you say it does,\NI will not be mocked by my grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.00,0:33:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.29,0:33:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.58,0:33:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.00,0:34:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.92,0:34:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the Arab's shop. Get some mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.00,0:34:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.67,0:34:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful. Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh, sh, sh, sh, sh. Ah. Just a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.96,0:34:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-There.\N-There?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.17,0:34:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.71,0:34:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, very carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.17,0:34:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,nice and slow…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.42,0:34:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Voilà.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.79,0:34:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.17,0:34:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we let it dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If this machine contains time and space,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.83,0:35:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything in between,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.29,0:35:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's able to capture God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.50,0:35:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would love this thing,\Nbut get that idea out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.75,0:35:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.50,0:35:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Teach me how it works!\N-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.13,0:35:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dry the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.08,0:35:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's first?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.46,0:35:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-We polish.\N-We polish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.38,0:35:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's our plate.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,White, red and black,\Nin that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.08,0:35:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. That's enough white.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.71,0:35:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now black.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.38,0:35:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In the family daguerreotype,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the only one to ever exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.75,0:36:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano had the same clairvoyant look
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.42,0:36:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that he would have years later\Nas he faced the firing squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.13,0:36:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But he still had not sensed\Nthe premonition of his own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.88,0:36:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, well, well.\N-It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.58,0:36:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aureliano! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.96,0:36:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.42,0:36:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle seeing you\Nout of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.25,0:36:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the only miracle is seeing you sober\Nat this time of day, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give him a break. At least he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.54,0:36:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you? It's nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Magnífico. And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.25,0:36:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran out of oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.54,0:36:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of us actually work,\Nknow what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's all that money\Neven good for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.42,0:36:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't have rum with your amigos?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.21,0:36:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.71,0:36:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Catarino! Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aurelito! Mijo.\NAren't you a sight for sore eyes, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.63,0:36:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, Catarino.\N-Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-How's the family?\N-They're doing well. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.46,0:36:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:36:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, give your dad my best, yeah?\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.96,0:37:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us three rums, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen! For just a few days in Macondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The one and only, the best, Eréndira!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.54,0:37:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only 20 centavos for her time!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.75,0:37:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Innocent Eréndira.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.58,0:37:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the mulatta\Neveryone's been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.25,0:37:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They say she's beautiful,\Na remarkable woman. Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.54,0:37:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, I'm good. Thank you.\N-Hey, come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is an experience\Nworthy of a Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.13,0:37:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.88,0:37:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still a virgin!\NWe're fixing that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.83,0:37:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-You ready?\N-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.92,0:37:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-All right, let's go.\N-Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no, no.\N-No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.71,0:37:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-You relax, my friend.\N-Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-We've got business to take care of…\N-I just came for acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.58,0:37:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the acid later!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey. Hey, hey, hey.\N-Just go. Fine. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.63,0:37:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.63,0:38:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends encouraged this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.96,0:38:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told to toss twenty centavos\Nin the tray and to be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.71,0:38:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tossing another twenty on your way out\Nwill buy you a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.88,0:39:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Have I done something wrong?\N-No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.46,0:39:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you ever rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.71,0:39:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my grandma's repaid, I can rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.96,0:40:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman standing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.04,0:40:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Around two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I lit a candle and fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.17,0:40:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When I woke up, I was surrounded by fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.04,0:40:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And the house turned to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How much do you owe her?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.79,0:40:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,seventy men per night
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.88,0:40:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,for… ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.63,0:40:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.79,0:41:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will throw in 20 pesos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.79,0:41:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.38,0:41:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred men.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.54,0:41:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.67,0:41:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.75,0:41:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are you all right?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you go to the lab\Nif you want to read?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.71,0:41:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.29,0:41:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just a kid, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.21,0:42:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but Visitación always talks about
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.13,0:42:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,how you foresaw the arrival\Nof Rebeca months ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.21,0:42:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.67,0:42:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.17,0:42:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you saw mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.13,0:42:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.63,0:42:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all of us are completely and desperately\Nalone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.54,0:42:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And knowing who your parents are\Nwon't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.67,0:42:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.33,0:43:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-You have no shame, do you?\N-Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.79,0:43:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.17,0:43:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We should always confide\Nin one another as sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, who's gonna keep your secrets\Nwhen you sneak out with your boyfriends?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.79,0:43:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,With whom? You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See, as soon as you go outside in this,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.79,0:43:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll all be circling you like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.54,0:43:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm!\N-No… no. Rebeca. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.42,0:43:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.96,0:43:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Rebeca, give me the towel!\N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.50,0:43:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca! Give me the towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.54,0:43:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.67,0:43:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula suddenly realized
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.71,0:43:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that her daughters\Nwere old enough to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And as if she had contracted\Nher husband's hallucinating fever,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.29,0:43:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,she undertook the expansion of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.88,0:44:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.71,0:44:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a dining room big enough\Nthat it can hold a table for 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.21,0:44:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? Well, go ahead. Go on. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.38,0:44:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And for this room, right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.00,0:44:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be a large hall decorated\Nwith the finest Viennese furniture,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.67,0:44:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and we will host the most\Ndistinguished parties in the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.63,0:44:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes? You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.25,0:44:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.29,0:44:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, I just swept.\NNow I have to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.50,0:44:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.50,0:44:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The windows in all nine bedrooms\Nshould face the patio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Separate bathrooms\Nfor the men and for the women,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.50,0:44:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and a kitchen large enough for two stoves.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.50,0:44:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Understood?\N-Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!\NEveryone, stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.92,0:45:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.71,0:46:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are you Mrs. Úrsula Buendía?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.96,0:46:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro Crespi.\NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.17,0:46:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought your order\Nfrom the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.96,0:46:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you\Nsome lemonade, Mr. Crespi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.13,0:46:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much,\Nma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.00,0:46:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How long\Nis that going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.83,0:46:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.58,0:46:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Signora, I'm not sure.\NYou see, it's a complex instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.92,0:46:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.42,0:47:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Signorine, a… apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.29,0:47:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.\NPietro Crespi. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.63,0:47:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.75,0:47:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta Buendía. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.38,0:47:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.46,0:47:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how long\Nis it going to take Mr. Crespi?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.71,0:47:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Signora,\Nabout a week, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.04,0:47:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. But with your permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.67,0:47:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I could teach your daughters how to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.04,0:47:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you know this, but lessons\Nare included with the instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.50,0:47:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.83,0:47:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I appreciate you offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.00,0:47:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-But that isn't necessary.\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.96,0:47:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, that would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.58,0:47:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we throwing a party\Nso we can celebrate the new house?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.88,0:47:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And for our presentation into society.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.38,0:48:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.46,0:48:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But Arcadio will be\Nwith the two of you at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.04,0:48:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And no touching either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.17,0:48:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.88,0:48:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, off you go.\NLet him work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.08,0:48:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,While José Arcadio
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.33,0:48:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,kept chasing after\NGod's ubiquitous, invisible traces…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro continued to work with a dedication
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.29,0:48:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,much like that of Aureliano\Nin his silverwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.96,0:49:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, José Arcadio?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.13,0:49:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense you're upset over something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.21,0:49:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.71,0:49:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.83,0:49:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it that I've captured
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.33,0:49:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,every corner of Macondo,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.88,0:49:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and God didn't present\Nhimself in any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.04,0:49:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.04,0:49:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really how you imagined God?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.25,0:49:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin by correcting our posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.79,0:49:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.33,0:49:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't be so obvious.\N-Sh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.79,0:49:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stretch out your arms\Nand remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.25,0:49:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.\NOne, two, three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.46,0:49:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.\NOne, two, three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.96,0:49:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.92,0:49:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.25,0:49:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now grab a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.63,0:50:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.\NOne, two, three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.92,0:50:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three. One, two, three. One…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.71,0:50:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.88,0:50:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside the pianola.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.00,0:50:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.83,0:50:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio,\Nyou're not making any sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.96,0:50:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should worry\Nabout your daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.71,0:50:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-And why should I?\N-What do you mean why?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Isn't it obvious?\N-What is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.38,0:51:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Their virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.88,0:51:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being preoccupied about their virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.33,0:51:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That man's a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.58,0:51:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been a pleasure, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.83,0:52:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Signorina Amaranta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.71,0:52:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Signora Úrsula.\NThanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.83,0:52:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been wonderful.\NI promise I'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.08,0:53:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you coming to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.88,0:54:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.58,0:54:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed to know how it works. You see--
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.58,0:54:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In two days,\Nevery single one of our friends is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.29,0:54:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And they'll be coming with their sons,\Npotential suitors for both your daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.25,0:54:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better figure out\Nhow to put that thing back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.46,0:54:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Beautiful night for a party, yes?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.38,0:54:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-See you inside.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.21,0:55:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-How are you?\N-Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.63,0:55:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.33,0:55:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good evening.\N-Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.21,0:55:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah! My dear friend.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.54,0:55:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NCome in, please. Come in. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.88,0:55:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Welcome, welcome.\N-Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.13,0:55:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-How are you? Good evening.\N-Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.92,0:55:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.33,0:55:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Visitación, please start\Nserving the biscuits, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.71,0:55:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nearly 30 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.88,0:55:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that we packed our things\Nand left that town.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.46,0:55:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And we decided to create a new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.88,0:55:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We created this with our own bare hands,\Nin the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.33,0:55:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows\Nwhere José Arcadio and I would be
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.54,0:55:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,had you all not had the faith\Nto join us in this mad adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.46,0:55:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, dear friend.\NDid you invite us here to cry or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.08,0:55:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.92,0:56:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, Magnífico.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.67,0:56:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't\Nabout to pass up the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.46,0:56:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell you that I've never forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.13,0:56:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that what we built belongs to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that it would be an honor
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.96,0:56:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,for our families to come together\Nthrough our daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that is if your boys\Nare ready for a bit of competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.88,0:56:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then let the party begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.75,0:56:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hear! Hear!\N-Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.67,0:56:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.29,0:57:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, may I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.67,0:57:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-You look beautiful tonight.\N-Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.38,0:57:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, should we show them how it's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.04,0:58:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, pardon me, sir. May I cut in?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.46,0:58:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the fairest woman\Nin all of Macondo, Rebeca Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.42,0:58:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.54,0:58:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.46,0:59:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.42,0:59:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The handfuls of earth
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.13,0:59:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,made her feel closer to the only man\Nworthy of such a display of degradation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.33,1:00:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still angry at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.21,1:00:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am not angry at you, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.58,1:00:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.50,1:00:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this the Buendía residence?\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.92,1:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an urgent message.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.29,1:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hereby notified.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.13,1:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.42,1:00:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone dropped this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.46,1:01:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sent by the government.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.08,1:01:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sent by the government?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.79,1:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He said\Nwe're hereby notified.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.96,1:01:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Notified?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.63,1:01:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It says that we all must\Npaint our houses blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.17,1:01:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Says who, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.79,1:01:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Judicial Officer of Macondo,\Nappointed by the Government of Colombia.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.25,1:01:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they do that? Judicial Officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.38,1:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.96,1:01:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the hell is Apolinar Moscote?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.83,1:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,BASED ON THE NOVEL\NBY GABRIEL GARCÍA MÁRQUEZ
